{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"No","category":"储能","country":"意大利","country_iso":"ITA","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:48:16.391845","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"ITA-ES-0002","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"意大利国家电网调频及消纳储能项目","project_name_en":"Italy National Grid Frequency Regulation and Renewable Energy Integration BESS Projects","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"晶科储能","content":"近日，晶科储能（Jinko ESS）在意大利连续斩获两个5MWh电网级储能项目，标志着其正式打开意大利大储市场。项目将分别于2025年10月与2026年3月交付晶科储能蓝鲸G2 5MWh液冷集装箱系统，为意大利国家电网提供调频支持及可再生能源消纳服务，加速该国实现\"2030年可再生能源占比45%\"目标。\n针对意大利南部40℃高温与北部-5℃低温环境，晶科储能蓝鲸G2系统通过智能液冷技术实现全气候精准控温，确保电芯间温差控制在±2.5℃，并利用多层防护，保证系统在极端恶劣天气下的极致安全性，94%系统循环效率以及辅助功耗降低15%，最大程度保证系统投资回报。\n。\n晶科储能欧洲区域总经理Roberto Murgioni强调：\"此次签订的两个项目验证了我们'南欧本地化服务战略'的有效性。继希腊，德国，英国项目后，意大利市场的突破使地中海区域布局更趋完善，晶科储能也将持续赋能意大利助力其清洁能源转型。\"","content_sha256":"0ab97580332565cc8a1aed3eb95e4cfe079ae73dd23516f26fa3f010cccc37f6","id":2732,"publish_date":"2025-07-22 08:24:57","title":"晶科储能连获意大利两大电网级储能项目 开启南欧市场新篇章","title_sha256":"7536df9de81b836177a74082f74f3dccf4ff02b23d6f154db8bbe81924ccc066","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/85446.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"ITA-ES-0002","capacity_details":"BESS: 10MW (2 x 5MWh)","capacity_mw":10.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"10","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:48:16.391902","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"ITA-ES-0002-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.jinkosolar.com/site/newsdetail/2705\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"晶科储能科技有限公司","pr